{"id":"z04-23","volume":4,"volumeTitle":"周纪四","volumeSubtitle":"前275","index":23,"title":{"t":"赧王四十年","s":"赧王四十年"},"book":{"t":"資治通鑑","s":"资治通鉴"},"sourceHead":{"t":"周紀四 · 前275 · 丙戌","s":"周纪四 · 前275 · 丙戌"},"author":"司马光","annotated":true,"paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"tr":"这一年攻魏的主帅，是秦国的相国穰侯。","tokens":[{"t":"秦","s":"秦","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"相","s":"相","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"國","s":"国","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"穰","s":"穰","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"侯","s":"侯","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"伐","s":"伐","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"魏","s":"魏","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]},{"tr":"暴鸢带着韩军来救魏国，被穰侯打垮，斩下的首级有四万。","tokens":[{"t":"韓","s":"韩","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"暴","s":"暴","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"鳶","s":"鸢","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"救","s":"救","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"魏","s":"魏","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"穰","s":"穰","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"侯","s":"侯","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"大","s":"大","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"破","s":"破","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"之","s":"之","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"斬","s":"斩","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"首","s":"首","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"四","s":"四","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"萬","s":"万","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]},{"tr":"暴鸢打了败仗，逃进启封躲了起来。","tokens":[{"t":"暴","s":"暴","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"鳶","s":"鸢","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"走","s":"走","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"啟","s":"启","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"封","s":"封","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]},{"tr":"魏国交出八座城，用来换取讲和。","tokens":[{"t":"魏","s":"魏","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"納","s":"纳","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"八","s":"八","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"城","s":"城","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"以","s":"以","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"和","s":"和","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]},{"tr":"穰侯再次攻打魏国，打跑芒卯，军队开进北宅。","tokens":[{"t":"穰","s":"穰","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"侯","s":"侯","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"復","s":"复","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"伐","s":"伐","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"魏","s":"魏","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"走","s":"走","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"芒","s":"芒","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"卯","s":"卯","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"入","s":"入","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"北","s":"北","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"宅","s":"宅","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]},{"tr":"接着包围大梁，魏国割让温，这才把和约谈成。","tokens":[{"t":"遂","s":"遂","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"圍","s":"围","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"大","s":"大","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"梁","s":"梁","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"魏","s":"魏","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"人","s":"人","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"割","s":"割","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"溫","s":"温","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"以","s":"以","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"和","s":"和","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]}],"lesson":{"background":"这一年是周赧王四十年，前275年。秦相国穰侯魏冉攻魏，韩国派暴鸢来救，救兵大败，暴鸢逃入启封。魏先交八城求和。穰侯不停手，再次进兵，赶跑魏将芒卯，进入北宅，包围魏都大梁，魏又割温求和。","theme":"魏国在一年里两次割地。第一次在暴鸢兵败之后交出八城，第二次在大梁被围之后割温。救兵被斩首四万，芒卯也被打跑。和约没有挡住下一次进兵，魏都大梁在这段纪事里被围住。","technique":"六句按战役次序往下排，中间没有对话，也没有臣光曰。先是出兵、破韩、追逃、交城，再是复伐、走将、围都、割地。「复」和「遂」把第二次进攻接在第一次和约之后，读起来和约并没有让战争停住。","keyContentWords":[{"word":"相国","reading":"xiàng guó","note":"秦国的首相。穰侯魏冉以这个身份领兵伐魏。"},{"word":"斩首","reading":"zhǎn shǒu","note":"砍下首级来计功。四万是这次打败暴鸢时斩杀的数目。"},{"word":"大梁","reading":"dà liáng","note":"魏国都城。穰侯第二次进兵，最后把这座都城围住。"},{"word":"启封","reading":"qǐ fēng","note":"暴鸢战败后逃进去的城。后来为避讳改称开封，这里仍用启封。"}],"keyFunctionWords":[{"word":"之","reading":"zhī","note":"代词，指暴鸢带来的韩军。「大破之」是把这支救兵打败。"},{"word":"以","reading":"yǐ","note":"用来。「纳八城以和」「割温以和」都是交出城或地，目的是讲和。"},{"word":"遂","reading":"suì","note":"于是。紧接进入北宅，接着写包围大梁。"}],"ancientModern":[{"word":"走","note":"「暴鸢走启封」是本人败逃；「走芒卯」是把芒卯打跑。都不是平常走路。"},{"word":"纳","note":"交出、献上。魏纳八城，是把城送给秦国以求停战。"},{"word":"和","note":"讲和、停战。不是和气、和谐。"}],"phoneticLoans":[],"flexibleUsage":[{"word":"走","note":"「走芒卯」的走是使动用法，意思是使芒卯逃走。同一年「暴鸢走启封」则是暴鸢自己逃。"}],"specialSyntax":[{"name":"以字表目的","note":"「纳八城以和」「割温以和」先写交出的东西，用以连接到讲和这个目的。"}]}}
